  "title": "Peruvian Chicken Soup (Aguadito de Pollo)",
  "description": "This traditional Peruvian soup contains large pieces of chicken breast and potato cooked with peas, corn, and red pepper. It is a light version of the Peruvian Chicken Chowder (Chupe de Pollo).",
